// =========================================================================
// handle_label   (Attribute Wrangle)
// Houdini node: /obj/geo5/ASA_AFFORDANCE      in0 = sweep1 (the handle tube)
// Labels the handle geometry as "handle" BEFORE the boolean; the Boolean
// keeps each input's attributes, so part_label finds the label afterwards.
// =========================================================================

s@affordance_part = "handle";
